    "category": "Non-Automatic Weighing Instrument",
    "type_designations": ["NCR 7812-5XXX series"],
    "description": "NCR 7812-5XXX series scanner/scale, Class III, mains operated, self-indicating, weight only, non-automatic weighing instrument. Designed for flush-mounting in checkout surface, having frame extensions to support the instrument in the checkout counter; intended to be installed in a fixed position in checkout and self-checkout counters, consequently no levelling device or level indicator is provided. Stainless steel load receptor, pole-mounted display. Devices: initial zero setting device, semi-automatic zero setting device, zero tracking device, automatic zero setting device, zero indicator, gravity compensation. Interface types: DC voltage input, RS-232, IMB-485, control inputs/outputs, USB. Equipped with an integrated single character seven segment display, also used to provide audit trail information from the two event counters. A powered USB interface can also be used to power the scale and barcode scanner."
